<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel='stylesheet' href='/stylesheets/style.css' />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/bootstrap/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css"/>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/@fortawesome/fontawesome-free/css/all.min.css"/>
    <script src="bootstrap/dist/js/bootstrap.min.js"></script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <%- include('header') %>
    <div class = "container my-4">
    <!-- Bootstrap function to center title text-->
    <h1 class="mb-3 text-center">Projects</h1>
      <!--Left Column for Two boxes on the left side-->
      <div id ="left-column">
          <div class ="box">
              <h2><i class="fa-brands fa-python"></i> Python - Doctor Appointment System</h2>
              <p>My group and I worked on a console-based
                  Doctor appointment system which involved features 
                  like sickness type, selection of doctors in a specific
                  field, date/time, and contact information.
              </p>
          </div>
          <div class ="box">
              <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-network-wired"></i> Networking Project</h2>
              <p>I worked in a group provided with an enterprise
                  network topology, where we worked on configurations to 
                  have secure connection and communication between multiple
                  LANs over the internet, utilising features like BGP and OSPF.
              </p>
          </div>
      </div>

      <!--Right Column for Two boxes on the right side-->
      <div id ="right-column">
          <div class ="box">
              <h2><i class="fa-brands fa-canadian-maple-leaf"></i> Business Builders - Maple Syrup Business</h2>
              <p>Not necessarily a project, it was a team game that involved me and 4 members
                  Managing different levels of a merchandising business. Maple syrup sellers, managing stock,
                  price levels, and how much money to put towards different aspects of the business.
              </p>
          </div>
          <div class ="box">
              <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-handshake"></i> Business Leadership Research Project</h2>
              <p>Me and four other group members did research on a famous NBA coach Phil Jackson
                  and explored how he succeeded and gained his reputation in the NBA world. Exploring 
                  the many types of leadership strategies he utilised to make his teams work well 
                  and how managed different personalities.
              </p>
          </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <%- include('footer') %>
  </body>
</html>